---
description: RevSense UI copy & voice rules
globs:
  - "frontend/**/*.tsx"
  - "backend/src/**/*.ts"
alwaysApply: true
---

RevSense is a car diagnostic/analysis tool — a recording is one input, not the headline.
User-facing copy must never surface implementation internals: AI provider names
(OpenRouter/Anthropic/OpenAI → "AI"), engine pattern counts ("29 known failure patterns"),
DSP jargon (FFT, spectral centroid, "acoustic clues"), or "rule engine". Privacy = one line:
"We don't save your recordings or results." Voice: Trustworthy · Clear · Practical — active,
plain, no buzzwords. Terminology: "diagnosis"/"your report", not "triage report".
Full rule: see `AGENTS.md`.
